flow v0
columns side main stop

section "Issue stage"
text maintainer "A maintainer adds the first label" col=main
pill needs-preparation tone=muted
box issue-preparer "writes scope and criteria" tone=agent
pill prep-stop "needs-human" col=stop row=issue-preparer tone=stop
pill ready col=main tone=done

section "Pull-request stage"
box implementer "codes, checks, opens the PR" tone=agent
pill needs-changes col=side row=implementer tone=rework
pill needs-review col=main tone=agent
box reviewer "reviews the exact head SHA" tone=agent
pill ready-to-merge tone=done
box integrator "updates base, checks, merges" tone=agent
end merged "Merged · issue closed"
panel stops col=stop row=implementer span=5 tone=stop
  strong "Stop"
  pill blocked
  pill needs-human
  muted "needs-human label or an Action needed comment"
  rule
  muted "A person decides and adds the trigger label of any role"
  muted "After blocked, the same role retries"

maintainer --> needs-preparation
needs-preparation --> issue-preparer
issue-preparer --> ready : prepared
issue-preparer --> prep-stop tone=stop : stop
ready --> implementer
implementer --> needs-review : handed-off
needs-review --> reviewer
reviewer --> ready-to-merge : approve
ready-to-merge --> integrator
integrator --> merged : merge
reviewer --> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.3 : request changes
ready-to-merge -.-> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.2 : on-conflict · launcher
integrator --> needs-changes tone=rework from=left to=bottom.1 : request changes
needs-changes --> implementer tone=rework : revise same PR
implementer --> stops tone=stop from=right to=left.1 : blocked
reviewer --> stops tone=stop from=right to=left.2 : blocked
integrator --> stops tone=stop from=right to=left.3 : blocked · maintainer merge
